<title>UK: Commonwealth Development Bank sets 100 mln stg 3-y.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth Development Bank sets 100 mln stg 3-y.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Salomon Brothers</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMONWEALTH DEVELOPMENT BANK OF AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0575  PAY DATE    28.APR97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.87     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AUS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLIHS   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT AUGUST 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
